#!args --selftest tests/cases
# jfs is a console program: cargo jflib test starts it with the arguments of the first line (and
# --script FILE, which it ignores).  --selftest runs every case of tests/cases/*.test: jfs started
# anew with the case's arguments, environment and input, its stdout, stderr, exit code and files
# compared with the expected ones (src/selftest.rs); exit code 1 when a case failed.
